        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "be73a383-836f-555e-a18e-38d800ab6a9b",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Elementary, Journey to the Edge of the Universe\n- People: Robert Doherty, Jonny Lee Miller, Lucy Liu, Sean Pertwee, Alec Baldwin, Sir Arthur Conan Doyle\n- Roles: Sherlock Holmes, Dr. Joan Watson, Inspector Lestrade, Captain Fitzpatrick, Sergeant Wells, Pilot Smith, Alfred Pennyworth\n- Topics: television series, acting credits, narration\n\nFacts:\n- Elementary is an American procedural drama television series that presents a contemporary update of Sir Arthur Conan Doyle's character Sherlock Holmes.\n- Elementary was created by Robert Doherty.\n- Jonny Lee Miller stars in Elementary as Sherlock Holmes.\n- Lucy Liu stars in Elementary as Dr. Joan Watson.\n- Lucy Alexis Liu, born on December 2, 1968, is an American actress, voice actress, director, producer, singer, and artist.\n- Sean Pertwee played Captain Fitzpatrick in the play Tom Jones, Sergeant Wells in Dog Soldiers, Pilot Smith in Event Horizon, Inspector Lestrade in CBS's Elementary, and Alfred Pennyworth in Fox's Gotham.\n- The US edition of Journey to the Edge of the Universe was narrated by Alec Baldwin.\n- The UK edition of Journey to the Edge of the Universe was narrated by Sean Pertwee.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
